---
source: tests/instas.rs
expression: "format! (\"{e:?}\")"
---
  x in comment on line 2
  |-> in Y-Statement starting on line 3
  |-> in paragraph 2 of that statement
  `-> Y-Statement did not match expected format
   ,-[3:2]
 1 |  In the context of <use case/user story u>, we faced <concern c>.
 2 | 
 3 |  We settled on <option o>, and passed over <other options>.
   :  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^|^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   :                               `-- expected "We decided for <..>, and neglected <..>."
 4 | 
 5 |  We did this to achieve <system qualities/desired consequences>, accepting
 6 |  <downside d/undesired consequences>.
   `----
  help: Note that punctuation is significant; you have to match every , and .
